<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>User Persona Development</title>

<style>

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: #f3f4f6;
}

header {
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px;
}

.container {
    width: 85%;
    margin: 35px auto;
}

.persona {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 35px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

.profile {
    text-align: center;
}

.avatar {
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    margin: auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e5e7eb;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 60px;
}

.profile h2 {
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.box {
    background: #f8f8fb;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
}

.box h3 {
    color: #4f46e5;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.goals {
    margin-top: 25px;
}

.goal {
    padding: 12px;
    background: #f8f8fb;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.frustrations {
    margin-top: 25px;
}

.frustration {
    padding: 12px;
    background: #fff1f2;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.quote {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-style: italic;
}

button {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 14px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
}

@media(max-width:700px) {

    .persona {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .details {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .container {
        width: 92%;
    }

}

</style>

</head>


<body>

<header>

<h1>User Persona Development</h1>

<p>Understanding the target user</p>

</header>


<div class="container">

<div class="persona">


<div class="profile">

<div class="avatar">
👨‍💻
</div>

<h2>Arun Kumar</h2>

<p>College Student</p>

<p>Age: 21</p>

</div>


<div>


<div class="details">

<div class="box">

<h3>Occupation</h3>

<p>Computer Science Student</p>

</div>


<div class="box">

<h3>Location</h3>

<p>Chennai, India</p>

</div>


<div class="box">

<h3>Technology</h3>

<p>Android Smartphone</p>

</div>


<div class="box">

<h3>Experience</h3>

<p>Intermediate User</p>

</div>

</div>


<div class="goals">

<h2>Goals</h2>

<div class="goal">
✓ Manage money easily
</div>

<div class="goal">
✓ Complete tasks quickly
</div>

<div class="goal">
✓ Track expenses
</div>

</div>


<div class="frustrations">

<h2>Frustrations</h2>

<div class="frustration">
✗ Complicated navigation
</div>

<div class="frustration">
✗ Too many steps
</div>

<div class="frustration">
✗ Small text
</div>

</div>


<div class="quote">

" I want an app that is simple, fast and easy to understand. "

</div>


<button onclick="downloadPersona()">
Save Persona
</button>


</div>

</div>

</div>


<script>

function downloadPersona() {

alert(
"User Persona Saved!\n\n" +
"Name: Arun Kumar\n" +
"Age: 21\n" +
"Occupation: College Student"
);

}

</script>

</body>

</html>
